{"id":"ni","lemma":"ni","pos":"adv","rank":102,"glosses":["Used in emphatic negations, not even","Forms an emphatic negative imperative, don't even"],"ipa":"/ˈni/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/7/77/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-Marreromarco-ni.wav","examples":[{"text":"No tienes ni idea...","en":"You have no idea.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/634120","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null,{"g":"idea"}]},{"text":"Ni siquiera sabemos quién estará allí.","en":"We don't even know who's going to be there.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301170","words":[null,{"g":"at least, at the least"},{"g":"to know, to understand","l":"saber"},{"g":"who"},{"g":"to be","l":"estar"},{"g":"there"}]},{"text":"No dije ni una palabra.","en":"I didn't say a word.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449075","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to say","l":"decir"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"word"}]},{"text":"Ni siquiera puedo hacer eso.","en":"I can't even do that.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/455413","words":[null,{"g":"at least, at the least"},{"g":"to be able to, can","l":"poder"},{"g":"to do"},{"g":"that","l":"ése"}]},{"text":"Eso no es ni gracioso.","en":"That's not even funny.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/461283","words":[{"g":"that","l":"ése"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},null,{"g":"funny, amusing"}]}]}